READING GUIDE
 Q1 (decoupling): compare Stage-1 vs Stage-2 rows. If Stage-2 keeps a
    much lower ADE while CR stays comparable, the ADE<->safety
    decoupling survives the mismatch.
 Q2 (CBF edge):  compare '+CBF' vs 'NO-CBF' CR. A large gap that
    persists across regimes shows the certificate's safety advantage
    is robust to model mismatch, not an artefact of a perfect model.
